  m_text: 'Interview suspects. Scroll through them with the arrows or A & D.

    Assign
    tags to them to make it easier to accuse the killer later.

    In the second
    phase, you will see a briefing with everything you know, and you will have to
    accuse someone.

    If you are wrong the killer will act again.

    Save as
    many people as possible.'
